@startuml SmartLost_Azure_Deployment
title SmartLost - UML Deployment Diagram\nAzure release infrastructure and CI delivery\nProposed semester deployment - not provisioned or verified

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam wrapWidth 180
skinparam maxMessageSize 65

actor "Deployment Operator" as operator

cloud "GitHub" as github {
  artifact "Protected repository configuration\nGitHub Secrets and Variables" as inputs
  node "GitHub-hosted runner" as runner <<executionEnvironment>> {
    artifact "GitHub Actions workflows\nInline Terraform and Azure CLI steps\nReviewed source and release digests" as workflow
  }
}

cloud "Azure for Students subscription" as azure {
  node "Microsoft Entra ID\nRepository/environment federation" as entra <<identityProvider>>
  node "Azure Resource Manager" as arm <<controlPlane>>

  node "Static Web Apps Free\nGlobal static content delivery" as swa <<managedHosting>> {
    artifact "Angular distribution\nPublic configuration only" as angular
  }

  package "Switzerland North - regional resources" as region {
    node "Shared ACR Standard\nOriginal Terraform state owns registry" as registry <<imageRegistry>> {
      artifact "SmartLost API and job images\nImmutable verified digests" as images
    }

    node "Terraform backend storage\nScoped SmartLost state key" as backend <<stateStorage>> {
      artifact "SmartLost Terraform state\nLocking enabled; no application secret values" as state
    }

    node "SmartLost Key Vault Standard" as vault <<secretStore>> {
      artifact "Runtime secret versions\nService database credentials\nJWT signing key and AI client credential" as secrets
    }

    node "Shared VNet\nReachable private database network" as vnet <<network>> {
      node "Shared Container Apps environment\nConsumption profile" as environment <<executionEnvironment>> {
        node "SmartLost API apps\nAuth and Listings: public HTTPS\nMatching: environment-internal HTTPS" as apps <<executionEnvironment>> {
          artifact "Auth API image" as authImage
          artifact "Listings image" as listingsImage
          artifact "Matching image\nNo model weights" as matchingImage
        }
        node "Service migration jobs\nFinite on-demand executions" as migrations <<executionEnvironment>> {
          artifact "Auth migration image\nListings migration image\nMatching migration image" as migrators
        }
        node "Database bootstrap job\nFinite privileged setup execution" as bootstrap <<executionEnvironment>> {
          artifact "Restricted SmartLost database/role setup\nSeparate from service migrators" as bootstrapImage
        }
        node "Processing jobs\nFinite scheduled executions" as workers <<executionEnvironment>> {
          artifact "Listings synchronisation entry point\nMatching feature-retry entry point" as workerImages
        }
      }

      node "Shared PostgreSQL Flexible Server\nB1ms - private network access" as postgres <<databaseServer>> {
        database "smartlost_auth" as authdb
        database "smartlost_listings" as listingsdb
        database "smartlost_matching" as matchingdb
      }
    }

    node "Blob Storage GPv2 LRS" as storage <<managedStorage>> {
      artifact "Private SmartLost photo container\nAnonymous access disabled" as photos
    }
  }
}

operator ..> workflow : Selects trusted revision and approved release
inputs ..> workflow : Supplies protected inputs\nNever printed or committed
workflow ..> entra : Exchanges GitHub OIDC assertion\nNo long-lived Azure client secret
workflow ..> arm : Plans/applies reviewed configuration\nShort-lived identity and scoped RBAC
workflow ..> state : Reads/writes own state with locking\nShared foundation read as data sources
workflow ..> images : Publishes/promotes verified release digests
workflow ..> secrets : Synchronises runtime copies over HTTPS\nDoes not imply database password rotation
workflow ..> angular : Uploads verified frontend distribution
workflow ..> migrations : Starts and tracks exact job executions\nThrough Azure management API
workflow ..> bootstrap : Runs initial authorised database/role setup\nBefore service migrations; tracks execution
arm ..> environment : Configures app/job revisions and identities
arm ..> swa : Configures static hosting
arm ..> vault : Configures vault and scoped permissions
arm ..> storage : Configures private photo storage
environment --> registry : Pulls authorised images by digest\nManaged identities
environment --> vault : Resolves authorised Key Vault references\nManaged identities
bootstrap --> postgres : Creates/updates only SmartLost databases and roles\nRestricted bootstrap credential; no other app data
migrations --> authdb : Auth migrator role\nCompatible versioned migrations
migrations --> listingsdb : Listings migrator role\nCompatible versioned migrations
migrations --> matchingdb : Matching migrator role\nCompatible versioned migrations

note bottom of migrations
  Migrate before app rollout; serialise executions and use DB advisory locks.
  Stop release on failure. Image rollback does not undo a schema migration.
  GitHub-hosted runners have no direct private database connection.
end note

note bottom of apps
  Candidate per app: 0.25 vCPU / 0.5 GiB, replicas 0 to 1.
  Verify actual memory, shared capacity and active student benefits.
  Existing Auth code and local Docker configuration do not prove Azure deployment.
end note

legend bottom
  Nested nodes show deployment locations; artifacts show deployed packages or stored data.
  Dotted arrows show delivery/configuration dependencies, not execution order.
  Solid arrows show infrastructure access; complete runtime traffic is in the C4 view.
  Shared foundation reuse is conditional on live access and capacity checks.
  Local AI is operated separately; CI does not start or keep the operator PC online.
  Deployment stays inactive until infrastructure and approval settings are configured.
endlegend
@enduml
